{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16646","headline":"忆长安 十一月 · 刘蕃","name":"忆长安 十一月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆长安，子月时，千官贺至丹墀。\n御苑雪开琼树，龙堂冰作瑶池。\n兽炭毡炉正好，貂裘狐白相宜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘蕃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}